name foliono
category Package
revision 58877
shortdesc Use folio numbers to replace page numbers
longdesc This package adds functionality to create several styles of
longdesc folio numbers. Folio numbering preceded the modern page
longdesc numbering convention and was in common use until the 18th
longdesc century. In folio numbering the numbers are placed only on odd
longdesc (right-side) pages and the numbers typically comprise of two
longdesc parts: quire and folio numbers. The intended use for this
longdesc package is to help creating old-style books.
